    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This coming-of-age story follows Coni, a mechanical engineer, who creates robots called Mechas to help humanity alongside her companion B1U3 \u2013 a Mecha she created in her own image. One day, she gets a sudden warning that all Mechas have started to malfunction and scattered around in the testing grounds of the lab. Coni sets out to find out what happened, fix the malfunctioning Mechas, and bring them back safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and fix quirky robots while solving environmental puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/e63e4d28d4ffcacadd2ea41472228a01.poster.avif?t=1751307848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/e63e4d28d4ffcacadd2ea41472228a01.webm?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/e63e4d28d4ffcacadd2ea41472228a01.mp4?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the lab testing grounds, each course provides a new challenge for Coni. You\u2019ll have to solve puzzles, avoid traps, defeat bosses, and diagnose issues with Mechas on her journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Persevere through each challenge and learn to accept your \u201cflaws\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/c0a5cea17161419cae4b05fee6844a63.poster.avif?t=1751307848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/c0a5cea17161419cae4b05fee6844a63.webm?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/c0a5cea17161419cae4b05fee6844a63.mp4?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate, accept, and trust in yourself to overcome challenges \u2013 accepting yourself leads to a greater purpose within in Mecha.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun for the whole family</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/7fefc8b3066267531b0893814bb44047.poster.avif?t=1751307848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/7fefc8b3066267531b0893814bb44047.webm?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/7fefc8b3066267531b0893814bb44047.mp4?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cozy wholesome adventure is designed with accessibility and playability in mind. This journey of learning to accept oneself is safe to share with players of all ages and abilities.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This coming-of-age story follows Coni, a mechanical engineer, who creates robots called Mechas to help humanity alongside her companion B1U3 \u2013 a Mecha she created in her own image. One day, she gets a sudden warning that all Mechas have started to malfunction and scattered around in the testing grounds of the lab. Coni sets out to find out what happened, fix the malfunctioning Mechas, and bring them back safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and fix quirky robots while solving environmental puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/e63e4d28d4ffcacadd2ea41472228a01.poster.avif?t=1751307848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/e63e4d28d4ffcacadd2ea41472228a01.webm?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/e63e4d28d4ffcacadd2ea41472228a01.mp4?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the lab testing grounds, each course provides a new challenge for Coni. You\u2019ll have to solve puzzles, avoid traps, defeat bosses, and diagnose issues with Mechas on her journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Persevere through each challenge and learn to accept your \u201cflaws\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/c0a5cea17161419cae4b05fee6844a63.poster.avif?t=1751307848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/c0a5cea17161419cae4b05fee6844a63.webm?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/c0a5cea17161419cae4b05fee6844a63.mp4?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate, accept, and trust in yourself to overcome challenges \u2013 accepting yourself leads to a greater purpose within in Mecha.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun for the whole family</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/7fefc8b3066267531b0893814bb44047.poster.avif?t=1751307848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/7fefc8b3066267531b0893814bb44047.webm?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359470/extras/7fefc8b3066267531b0893814bb44047.mp4?t=1751307848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This cozy wholesome adventure is designed with accessibility and playability in mind. This journey of learning to accept oneself is safe to share with players of all ages and abilities.</p>",
